her light administrative projects. Qualifications A dependable student who arrives on time for shifts, is open to learning basic office software, and can adapt to daily office needs as they pop up. Comfortable interacting with visitors politely (in person or on the phone) and able to carefully follow checklists to process student paperwork and maintain confidentiality regarding sensitive student data. Willing to share an honest student perspective on whether draft office guides are clear or confusing.",
