      "description": "Posted: 2026-08-25 Location: Institute of Pathology, 2085 Adelbert Rd, Pathology 419, Cleveland, Ohio 44106 Primary job duties involve helping with tissue inventory, particularly slide and block filing, and/or frozen tissue inventory. May assist with clinical data entry. Hourly rate: $14/hour. CWRU Student, preferably a 3rd or 4th year Biology or Chemistry major.",
