      "description": "Posted: 2026-09-03 Location: 2109 Adelbert Rd. Cleveland, OH 44106 Case Western Reserve University School of Medicine Department of Biochemistry Graduate IT Assistant 1. Provide general hardware and software support; troubleshoot pc/printer problems and software programs. 2. Set up new pcs and printers downloading needed software/drivers. 3. Assist with audio visual equipment set ups, operation, and maintenance. 4. Assist department in keeping new monitor running; update as necessary. 5. Assist with departmental web site development and maintenance. 6. Assist with Unix operating systems. 7. Familiarity with both Windows and Apple operating systems would be a plus. 8. Prepare backups for pcs, and other duties as assigned. Hourly rate for this position is $15. 10 hours a week.",
