    "https://apply.interfolio.com/185739": {
      "title": "Student Swim Instructor - Daytime",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-06-29 Location: One to One at Veale Athletic Center Swim Instructor position: Must have an excellent knowledge of proper swimming stroke techniques. Demonstrate your ability to evaluate your client's performance and provide appropriate and constructive feedback for success. Must have prior experience with teaching swim lessons, particularly with adult clients. American Red Cross WSI certification is preferred. Other duties and procedures as needed. Late afternoon/evening hours required. Flexible hours preferred! This position pays $15 per 30 minute lesson and $25 per 60 minute lesson. Let us know if you are also a certified Lifeguard and would be interested in lifeguarding as well. Work Location: In person Experience : Swim Instruction: 1 year (Preferred) License/Certification: Lifeguard Certification? (Preferred) First Aid/CPR/AED Certification? (Preferred)",
      "department": "UGEN (STUDENT)"
