    },
    "https://apply.interfolio.com/188056": {
      "title": "Technical Services Assistant - WORK STUDY ONLY",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-08-01 Location: Ingalls Library, The Cleveland Museum of Art Pay rate: $12.22/hour General description : Performs basic library activities and general office duties. Requires a high level of attention to detail. Flexible schedule within the library’s operating hours of Monday-Friday, 9 am-4 pm. Responsibilities include : Receiving Unpack boxes of new materials Sort and shelve materials based on invoices Search serial issues and monographs for CMA references & objects Shelving Organizing books alphabetically in the cataloging backlog Shelving books in the cataloging backlog Shelving auction catalogs in the library stacks spaces Preferred qualifications : Must have work study Undergraduate Previous library experience Foreign language knowledge Please apply through Interfolio if you are interested in this position.",
