    "https://apply.interfolio.com/188127": {
      "title": "Library Processing Assistant - WORK STUDY ONLY",
      "description": "Posted: 2026-08-01 Location: Ingalls Library, The Cleveland Museum of Art Pay rate: $12.22/hour Processing Perform physical processing of library materials Perform basic preservation such as creating book jackets Assist with preparing and receiving bindery shipments Shelving Organizing books alphabetically in the cataloging backlog Shelving serials in the Library Lounge Additional tasks to be assigned by supervisor Must have work study Undergraduate Skills required: Basic computer skills Hand skills Attention to detail/craftsmanship Preferred qualifications: Previous library experience, Being a crafty person Please apply through Interfolio if interested.",
