      "description": "Posted: 2026-05-26 Location: CWRU: Department of Bilogy: Millis Hall Lab research assistant position is open for undergraduate student to perform general lab tasks of glassware cleaning, media preparation and care of live Drosophila stocks. Training will be provided. No prior experience is required. Plan is to start the position during 2026 summer plus two additional semesters. Preferred work schedule in the morning or full day, 8-10 hrs per week. Salary rate = $12.22 / hr No prior experience is required.  Preference is given to Biology students with strong work ethics and communicaiton skills.",
